    "title": "Job Opening Production Engineer at Astral Pipes",
    "description": "Astral Pipes, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Production Engineer for our Jaipur operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout Astral Pipes:\nAstral Pipes is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Ensure environmental compliance and waste management\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Manage supplier quality audits and vendor development\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBBS / MD / MS from recognized medical college\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n• Proficiency in Root Cause Analysis\n• Proficiency in SolidWorks\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n• Proficiency in ISO 9001\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Referral bonus program\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Jaipur, Rajasthan, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Astral Pipes!",
